<title>FRANCE: Carrefour 1996 net attrib 3.12 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Carrefour 1996 net attrib 3.12 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   3,123  vs	   3,536</p>
<p>    Net attributable, pre-exceptional    3,239  vs	   2,690</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			 26  vs	   21.30</p>
<p>    Exceptional losses			   116  vs   gain    846</p>
<p>    Turnover				   154,905  vs	 144,612</p>
<p>    Cashflow				     7,803, up 18.1 percent</p>
<p>    Investments				 13,010  no comparison</p>
<p>NOTE - Carrefour gave its results in a statement. It said gross debt was 32.2 percent of equity capital in 1996 compared to 24.3 percent in 1995. The dividend payout took account of a one-for-two share bonus issue last May.</p>
<p>The exceptional loss of 116 million francs arose mainly from the sale of Price Costco and an exceptional writedown of the holding in Cora.</p>
<p>Pretax sales rose 7.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
